  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "企業勞動管理實務",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICES IN LABOR MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程著重勞動管理內容、方法、智慧科技應用於勞資爭議解決方案之實務訓練。課程中，學生可以透過實務案例及專題模擬演練勞資爭議預防、資料保全、事件預防、以及事件發生後之處理方式。",
    "describe_eh": "To meet the new regulatory labor law requirements, this course provides students new concepts and skills in managing labor relations. This course focuses on the new processes, methods, and technology uses of labor management that expects to mediate the risk of labor legal issue. Students are able to practice the solution for labor issues through case study and project assignment in the class.",
